 could start. The only near-overlap is 1444's last inbound event, from node 1962 in [46600,46900] (step_15); 563's outgoing contacts in the preceding 1400 units were 171,178,330,397,459,1157,1926 (step_16), none of which is 1962, and 1962 is not among 563's 66 out-neighbours at all (step_03). 1444 is also almost purely a sink (single out-edge, to 1904; step_14), further limiting relay structure. Static 2-hop connectivity exists in the ignoring-time subgraph (step_05) and both nodes are well-connected hubs (step_02) within a busy graph (step_01), but these are the confounders the task warns about: the ordering constraint is violated.", "confidence": 0.72, "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_06", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_07", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_09", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_13", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_15", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_16", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_04", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_05", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_14", "role": "confounder_control"}]}, "raw_final_response": "```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_39db5e56\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [563, 1444],\n  \"window\": [20435, 58834],\n  \"narrative\": \"There is no direct 563->1444 edge (step_03/step_04), so any cascade must be multi-hop with <=600-unit gaps. The temporal profiles are essentially reversed: 1444's inbound activity is front-loaded (30+17+10 of its 66 events in [20435,34834], decaying to 0 after ~47500; step_07/step_09), while 563's outbound activity is almost entirely late (59 of 67 events after 44435, 28 in the last bucket; step_06). In 563's early windows it emitted only one event, to node 303 at [20435,22000] (step_12) and nothing in [30035,32000] (step_13), so there is no early seed from which a 600-gap chain to 1444's dense early inbound traffic could start. The only near-overlap is 1444's last inbound event, from node 1962 in [46600,46900] (step_15); 563's outgoing contacts in the preceding 1400 units were 171,178,330,397,459,1157,1926 (step_16), none of which is 1962, and 1962 is not among 563's 66 out-neighbours at all (step_03). 1444 is also almost purely a sink (single out-edge, to 1904; step_14), further limiting relay structure. Static 2-hop connectivity exists in the ignoring-time subgraph (step_05) and both nodes are well-connected hubs (step_02) within a busy graph (step_01), but these are the confounders the task warns about: the ordering constraint is violated.\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.72,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_06\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_07\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_09\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_13\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_16\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_05\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_01\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_14\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"}\n  ]\n}\n```", "total_input_tokens": 53477, "total_output_tokens": 7476, "total_tokens": 60953, "total_latency_ms": 105824, "llm_calls": 9, "schema_repairs": 0, "status": "success", "error": ""}